# Calendar files are CRLF by RFC 5545 and must stay that way on disk and in the
# published bytes. Without this, git's text=auto normalisation strips the CRs
# somewhere between an author's machine and the deploy, and the feed goes out
# LF-only. That has happened to a live GitHub Pages feed before. Mark them
# binary-ish so nothing rewrites the line endings in either direction.
*.ics -text
